.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-gitea-repo-fork 1  "geectl-gitea-repo-fork 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-gitea\-repo\-fork \- Fork a repository into the token owner\*(Aqs account (or an organization with `\-\-organization`). A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the fork
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl gitea repo\-fork\fR [\fB\-\-new\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-organization\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOWNER\fR> <\fIREPO\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fork a repository into the token owner\*(Aqs account (or an organization with `\-\-organization`). A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the fork
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-new\-name\fR \fI<NEW_NAME>\fR
Name for the fork; defaults to the source repo name
.TP
\fB\-\-organization\fR \fI<ORGANIZATION>\fR
Organization to fork into; defaults to the token owner\*(Aqs account
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIOWNER\fR>
The repository owner
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>
The repository name
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
